bound-miner is a modified build of BOUND (https://github.com/Sonic-Bound/Bound), v1.1.0.
BOUND is copyright its authors and is used under the MIT license (see LICENSE, unchanged).

Changes in this build, by ilgio:
  - mining on NVIDIA GPUs through CUDA (boundd --gpu, --gpubatch, bound-gpubench)
  - no mining until the node is in step with the network
  - a 5% developer fee on blocks mined on mainnet (see DEVFEE.md)
This is an unofficial build, not made or endorsed by the BOUND project.
